{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sheep Quest",
    "steam_appid": 3375070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/2370eb2b68a2cfba552e07835d1a8794.avif?t=1747898922\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sheep Quest</i> is a high-difficulty 2D platformer where you, a sheep of questionable qualifications and more courage than sense, are chosen by providence for a special quest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across traps clearly designed by sadists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that probably made sense to someone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face up against six bosses, each eager to remind you that wool is not armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 handcrafted levels await you, each more determined than the last to send you plummeting into the void.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab fate by the horns and discover the secrets of the universe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new abilities as you progress\u2014 double jump, ground slam, attack, dodge \u2014 transforming from a helpless lamb into a force capable of shaking the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey from the pastoral to the cosmic:<br>Launch to the moon, duel mechanical werewolves, brave alternate dimensions, and ascend to battle ancient gods beyond space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you withstand the onslaught, seize your golden destiny, and bring the universe to its absurd conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.poster.avif?t=1747898922\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.webm?t=1747898922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/2370eb2b68a2cfba552e07835d1a8794.avif?t=1747898922\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sheep Quest</i> is a high-difficulty 2D platformer where you, a sheep of questionable qualifications and more courage than sense, are chosen by providence for a special quest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across traps clearly designed by sadists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that probably made sense to someone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face up against six bosses, each eager to remind you that wool is not armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 handcrafted levels await you, each more determined than the last to send you plummeting into the void.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab fate by the horns and discover the secrets of the universe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new abilities as you progress\u2014 double jump, ground slam, attack, dodge \u2014 transforming from a helpless lamb into a force capable of shaking the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey from the pastoral to the cosmic:<br>Launch to the moon, duel mechanical werewolves, brave alternate dimensions, and ascend to battle ancient gods beyond space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you withstand the onslaught, seize your golden destiny, and bring the universe to its absurd conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.poster.avif?t=1747898922\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/eef3bc932f5cedc72af2adbb9376dcd8.webm?t=1747898922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a surreal odyssey from humble pastures to the very ends of existence in Sheep Quest; a game for the gentleman of refined taste. Overcome obstacles in your struggle against wolf-kind in the definitive atmospheric frustration platformer.",
